OL,3,GNEWSAChildren who died in fire 'were
OL,4,Ahappy and loved'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamily and friends of a woman who died
OL,7,Falongside her three children in a house
OL,8,Ffire in Merseyside have been paying
OL,9,Ftheir respects.
OL,11,FThe fire, inside a property on Stone
OL,12,FSquare in Bootle, "spread rapidly" in
OL,13,Fthe early hours of Tuesday morning. An
OL,14,Finjured man who was outside the house
OL,15,Fwhen fire crews arrived remains in
OL,16,Fhospital.
OL,18,FA growing collection of teddy bears,
OL,19,Fflowers, balloons, cards and
OL,20,Fphotographs of the family have been
OL,21,Fleft near the scene.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
