OL,3,GNEWSAChildren who died in fire 'were
OL,4,Ahappy and loved'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRachel, who grew up near the mother,
OL,7,Ftold the BBC: "She made her children
OL,8,Fhappy, she did everything for her
OL,9,Fchildren." She added: "They were loved.
OL,10,FIt's just really, really sad."
